(27, 34, NULL, 'Camilia – AfroSoul & Guitars', 'camilia-afrosoul-guitars', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 150 WAV Loops (Drum Percussion, Melody and Guitar Loops)<br>&bull; 76 MIDI Files (Kick, Snare, Bongo, Chords, and Melodies)<br>&bull; 74 One-Shots<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Camilia - AfroSoul &amp; Guitars\' by VeshBeats is an All-In-One Sample Pack with Soulful Guitars that will help you breathe fresh air into your Afrobeats records. This pack comes loaded with 150 WAV Loops, 76 MIDI Files, and 74 One-Shots.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Let Those Drums &amp; Melodies Feed Your Soul with Camilia!! This pack was inspired by CKay, Wizkid, Adekunle Gold, Simi, Wande Coal, Burna Boy, Wurls, Lojay, Ed Sheeran, FireBoy, and Oxlade. You will receive all sounds separated as drums, percussions, and instruments. In addition, all sounds have been processed and edited using professional outboard gear to ensure authentic Live Experience and analog warmth.</p>', 4500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qFXJqX2rMr2nzU81sMKQFgIWAJREq_fV/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d484a5838e3_Vesh-Camilla-v-1.webp', 'Commercial', '588 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/56601/camilia%20full%20demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Vesh-Beats-Camilia-AfroSoul-Guitars.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-24 20:54:13', '2025-10-14 11:10:30', NULL),
