(30, 34, NULL, 'FAAJI - Afrobeats & Guitars', 'faaji-afrobeats-guitars', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 135 WAV Loops:<br>&bull; 70 Guitar Loops<br>&bull; 24 Melodic Loops<br>&bull; 41 Drum Loops<br>&bull; 15 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 46 One-Shots:<br>&bull; 15 One Shot Instruments<br>&bull; 31 One Shot Drums<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'FAAJI - Afrobeats and Guitars\' by Inqboi Beatz, is the latest in a line of iconic sample packs with 190+ Files in Total, including 135 WAV Loops, 15 MIDI Files, and 46 One-Shots. If you\'re after the next big hit, look no further than this Premium Afrobeats Guitar Loops collection.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This Pack will guarantee you a smashing AfroBeat Record sure of topping worldwide charts and billboards with the most heartwarming Guitar Melodies, Drums, and more. Each of these original guitar loops can form the core of your next courseion and has been recorded using the finest guitars, with the best mics, best preamps, and performed by a world-class musician. It simply doesn\'t get any higher in quality right across the board!</p>', 3700.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZV9sbDC6l-gYm2EinYHKnp1AcHIA90ZV/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d50d6c3cbb7_FAAJI-Afrobeat-and-Guitars-Cover-1.webp', 'Commercial', '411 mb', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/58642/FAAJI%20AFROBEAT%20AND%20GUITARS.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Inqboi-FAAJI--Afrobeats-Guitars.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 06:37:48', '2025-10-14 10:42:22', NULL),
(31, 34, NULL, 'BLUEPRINT – Afrobeats MIDI Chord Pack', 'blueprint-afrobeats-midi-chord-pack', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 75 Total Files<br>&bull; 248 MB<br>&bull; 24-Bit Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free<br>&bull; Loops:<br>&bull; 5 Kits<br>&bull; 10 Hi-Hat Loops<br>&bull; 6 Drum Loops<br>&bull; 6 Kick Loops<br>&bull; 5 808 Loops<br>&bull; 5 Flute Loops<br>&bull; 5 Perc Loops<br>&bull; 5 Pluck Loops<br>&bull; 5 Snare Loops<br>&bull; 5 Top Loops<br>&bull; 3 String Loops<br>&bull; 3 Lead Loops<br>&bull; 2 Clap Loops<br>&bull; 2 Piano Loops<br>&bull; 2 Brass Loops<br>&bull; 1 Cymbal Loop<br>&bull; 1 Pad Loop</p>\r\n<p><strong>\'BLUEPRINT\' by Manifxt Sound is an Afrobeats MIDI Pack loaded with 125 MIDI Files, Your ultimate Afrobeats MIDI Chord Pack, Blending infectious rhythms, uplifting melodies, and soulful vibes. Elevate your music and create unforgettable melodies. It all starts with BLUEPRINT! Whether you\'re a producer, musician, or songwriter, BLUEPRINT is your secret weapon to unlock the full potential of your Afrobeat creations.</strong></p>', 1900.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GRQ3FdoKomFkqdqgR_DKtlojlwJh_oWo/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68ee2870343d9_BLUEPRINT – Afrobeats MIDI Chord Pack cover.webp', 'Commercial', '74 KB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/64356/BLUEPRINT%20%E2%80%93%20Afrobeats%20MIDI%20Chord%20Pack%20demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Manifxt-Sound-BLUEPRINT-Afrobeats-MIDI-Chord-Pack.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 06:44:26', '2025-10-14 10:40:19', NULL),
(32, 34, NULL, 'ELYSIUM – Afrobeats Sample Pack', 'elysium-afrobeats-sample-pack', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 61 WAV Loops (Including Basses, Melodics, and Vocals)<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'ELYSIUM\' by Mykah is an Afro Sample Pack loaded with 209 MB of content, including 61 WAV Loops. An essential resource within the Afrobeats music courseion, This sample pack caters to producers and musicans seeking to infuse their tracks with the distinctive rhythms and melodies characteristic of Afrobeats and its subgenres. It provided quality and inspiration for producers across various musical contexts.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Whether crafting infectious dancefloor anthems or exploring more introspective musical territories, this pack is a valuable tool for sparking creativity and achieving professional-grade results. Featuring an array of expertly crafted sounds including:</p>', 3800.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/10f5MD7Mg9ePrfGaf1ijQo-jT3K208vbp/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d510a2a6036_ELYSIUMAfrobeatsSamplePackcover.webp', 'Commercial', '66 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/67682/ELYSIUM%20%E2%80%93%20Afrobeats%20Sample%20Pack%20demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Mykah-ELYSIUM-Afrobeats-Sample-Pack.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 06:51:30', '2025-10-12 09:22:34', NULL),
(33, 34, NULL, 'Afromelt', 'afromelt', '<p><iframe src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/soundcloud%253Atracks%253A1938277814&amp;color=%23ff5500&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false&amp;show_teaser=true\" frameborder=\"no\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe></p>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc; line-break: anywhere; word-break: normal; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif; font-weight: 100;\"><a style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\" title=\"Touch Loops\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/touchloops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Touch Loops</a> &middot; <a style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\" title=\"Afromelt\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/touchloops/afromelt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Afromelt</a></div>\r\n<p><strong>Included:<br>Size:&nbsp;</strong>333.8mb<strong><br>Loops:&nbsp;</strong>111<strong><br>One Shots:&nbsp;</strong>50<strong><br>Tempos:&nbsp;</strong>120-140Bpm<br><strong>Styles -&nbsp;</strong>Timeless Afrobeats Samples, Analog Bass loops, Horns, Mallets, Guitars and vocal chops. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1>Expertly Produced Afrobeats Drum Samples</h1>\r\n<p>Our latest selection see\'s the return of the mighty \'Fantastic\' to the roster! With numerous courseions, sample packs and writing credits under his belt, this guy knows a thing or two about the Afrobeats sound. From the genre defining, off-beat brass stabs to his hard hitting, trademark drums, this one goes deep!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>Trademark Afrobeats Loops &amp; Samples</h2>\r\n<p>Digging into this selection you\'ll find samples from a producer who loves to push the boundaries of this genre. With tempo\'s ranging from 120-140 Bpm, some serious ground is covered in the look and feel of the drums especially.&nbsp;<br>Switching between 2 / 4 snare patterns to more half step, swung grooves the pack leans in and borrows grooves that could equally work in garage or dubstep.</p>\r\n<p>To compliment this temporal masterclass you\'ll find warm analog subs, timeless mallet loops, live and organic percussion samples, rich synth work and to round it all off some expertly chopped vocal loops.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>Exquisite Royalty Free One Shots&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p>So, if you\'re an Afrobeats fan, love Fantastic\'s courseions or just starting out then this one hits all the right notes. Endlessly creative, authentic and always 100% royalty free. Download now!&nbsp;</p>', 8500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1foDxe8Qw8RpbaZ8apRuxA2xjBYJ9G2TB/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d512982a494_Afromelt2_1080x.webp', 'Commercial', '218', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', '', 'https://touchloops.com/courses/afromelt', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 06:59:52', '2025-10-12 09:01:28', NULL),
(34, 34, NULL, 'Thiago Afrobeats', 'thiago-afrobeats', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 5 Mixed &amp; Mastered Demos<br>&bull; 79 WAV Loops<br>&bull; 59 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 34 One Shots<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; WAV 24bit / HQ<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free&nbsp;<br>&bull; 435 MB (Unzipped)<br>&bull; 322 MB (Zipped)</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Thiago Afrobeats\' by Godlike Loops&nbsp;is equipped with the essential sounds and materials needed to create that smashing Afrobeat&nbsp;records. It comes with 170+ Files, including 79 WAV Loops, 34 Drums &amp; FX&nbsp;One-Shots, and 59 MIDI Files inspired by Daddy Yankee, MFR Souls, Youssoupha, Nicky Jam, Wizkid, Burna Boy, Kizz Daniel, Davido, Tems, Buju, Omah Lay, Teni and more.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This pack will provide you with must-have samples to help you produce your next hit track including Guitars, Pianos, Saxes, Flues, Leads, Rhodes, Log Drums, Kotos, Pads,&nbsp;Basses, Kick Loops, Snare &amp; Rim Loops,&nbsp;Shaker Loops, Various Perc Loops, Full / Top Drum Loops, MIDI loops and Drums &amp; Bass One Shots.</p>\r\n<p>MIDI files are included, so you can rework all the elements to fit into any project.</p>\r\n<p>And of course, all loops &amp; samples are 100% Royalty-Free!</p>', 5700.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X6NLqsdrP07JSO3IekxTYU09wHgBtRoZ/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d517c4647e5_Thiago Afrobeats Graphic JPG.webp', 'Commercial', '238 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/57739/Thiago%20Afrobeats%20Demo%20mp3.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Godlike-Loops-Thiago-Afrobeats.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 07:21:56', '2025-10-12 08:55:33', NULL),
(35, 34, NULL, 'PHONE CALLS – Afrobeats Sample Pack', 'phone-calls-afrobeats-sample-pack', '<p><audio controls=\"controls\" src=\"https://producersources.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/PHONE-CALLS-Afrobeats-Sample-Pack-demo-1.mp3\"></audio></p>\r\n<h3><strong>course DETAILS:</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>76 WAV Loops</strong> <em>(Including Drums and Melodics)</em><br><strong>40 MIDI Files</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality</strong><br><strong>BPM and Key Labeled</strong><br><strong>100% Royalty-Free</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Size: 623MB</strong>&nbsp;<em>(Unzipped)</em></p>\r\n<p><strong>\'PHONE CALLS\'</strong> by <em>Jerry Martin</em> is an Afrobeats Sample Pack loaded with<strong> 623MB</strong>&nbsp;of content, including <strong>76 WAV Loops </strong>and<strong> 40 MIDI Files. </strong>This guitar-based, afro-inspired collection is perfect for crafting hits in Afrobeats and Dancehall, It blends vibrant guitar riffs, rhythmic grooves, and melodic elements that capture the essence of both genres, offering a great soundkit for producers looking to create infectious hit records.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re aiming to capture the upbeat, dance-inducing energy of dancehall or the smooth, soulful vibes of Afrobeats, \"PHONE CALLS\" provides all the essential ingredients to bring your musical ideas to life. Featuring an array of expertly crafted sounds and tools including:</p>\r\n<p><strong>WAV Loops:</strong> Offering you must-have samples to produce your next hit tracks, including <em>Drums, Percussions, Basses, Melodies, Chords, Keys, Guitars, </em> and more.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stems: </strong>They\'re included to digitally edit individual song sections, allowing producers to have more creative control over the sound.</p>\r\n<p><strong>MIDI Files:</strong> Offering producers instant inspiration and endless creative possibilities. With MIDI files included, You can customize melodies to suit unique styles and visions, ensuring each composition stands out.</p>', 1500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/106nzxm9ZwDUuMOm9S4hqU5WGV07t-t7U/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d518ef549ee_PHONE-CALLS-Afrobeats-Sample-Pack-cover.webp', 'Commercial', '426 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', '', 'https://producersources.com/course/phone-calls-afrobeats-sample-pack/', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 07:26:55', '2025-10-12 08:52:49', NULL),
(36, 34, NULL, 'Rosafrica Afrobeats', 'rosafrica-afrobeats', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 4 Construction Kits<br>&bull; 90 Total Loops<br>&bull; 45 Melody Loops<br>&bull; 35 Drums Loops<br>&bull; 23 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 44.1kHz/24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; BPM &amp; Key Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Rosafrica Afrobeats\' by Innoy is a vibrant and eclectic sample pack that bridges the rich cultural heritage of traditional Moroccan &amp; Arabic music with the dynamic and energetic sounds of contemporary Afrobeats. This pack features an array of authentic Moroccan instruments, rhythms and melodies, seamlessly blended with modern Afrobeats grooves, creating a unique and inspiring fusion.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Perfect for producers looking to infuse their tracks with exotic flair and rhythmic complexity, \'Rosafrica Afrobeats\' offers a diverse selection of loops, samples and melodic phrases that capture the essence of both musical worlds. Whether you\'re crafting a dancefloor anthem or a cinematic soundtrack, this sample pack provides the tools to elevate your courseions with a fresh, cross-cultural sound.</p>', 2900.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YrevHMgkkDSpQb1VM2vvrXRGW7IFpCcY/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d51a3dd6da7_1-811.webp', 'Commercial', '98 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/64612/Rosafrica%20Afrobeats%20demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Innoy-Rosafrica-Afrobeats.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 07:32:29', '2025-10-12 08:50:08', NULL),
(37, 34, NULL, 'Afrology: Afrobeats & Guitars Vol 2', 'afrology-afrobeats-guitars-vol-2', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 122 WAV Loops<br>&bull; 54 Drums &amp; Percussion Loops<br>&bull; 45 Melody Loops<br>&bull; 10 Bass Loops<br>&bull; 13 Vocal &amp; Other Loops<br>&bull; 30 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 54 One-Shots<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Afrology: Afrobeats &amp; Guitars\' By Inqboi Beatz will help you breathe fresh air into your modern Afrobeat records with 120+ WAV Loops, including 54 Drums &amp; Percussion Loops, 45 Melody Loops, 10 Bass Loops, 13 Vocal &amp; Other Loops as well as 30 MIDI Files and 54 One-Shots. It is inspired by the sounds of Wizkid, Burnaboy, Davido, Yemi Alade, Rema, Ckay, D Banj, and more.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This Pack will guarantee you a smashing AfroBeat Record sure of topping worldwide charts and billboards with the most heartwarming Melodies, Chords, Guitar Riffs, Drums, and Loops. All loops have been labeled with BPM and key information for an easy project. There\'s enough headroom available to guarantee you a solid mix that is compatible with most DAWs.</p>\r\n<p>And of course, all loops &amp; samples are 100% Royalty-Free!</p>', 4300.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PW7LVJrBlN9caofRPk8eDrd8pNzu0BSJ/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d51ffd970c5_Afrology2-Cover.webp', 'Commercial', '312', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/56557/Afrology%202%20Demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Inqboi-Afrology-Afrobeats-Guitars-Vol-2.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 07:57:01', '2025-10-12 08:48:27', NULL),
(38, 34, NULL, 'Afro Sauce - Afrobeats', 'afro-sauce-afrobeats', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 5 Mixed &amp; Mastered Demos<br>&bull; 75 Melody and Drum Loops<br>&bull; 37 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 31 Afrobeat WAV One Shots<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labeled<br>&bull; WAV 24bit / HQ<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Afro Sauce - Afrobeats\' by Godlike Loops is equipped with the essential sounds and materials needed to create that smashing Afrobeat records. It comes with 145+ Files, including 75 Melody &amp; Drum WAV Loops, 31 Drums &amp; Fx One-Shots , and 37 MIDI Files inspired by Ckay, Wizkid, Burna Boy, 1da Banton, Kizz Daniel, Tiwa Sawage, L.A.X and more...</strong></p>\r\n<p>This pack will provide you with must-have samples to help you produce your next hit track including Guitars, Leads, Keys, Plucks, Violins, Saxes, Basses, Kick Loops, Snare &amp; Rim Loops, Shaker Loops, Various Perc Loops, Full / Top Drum Loops, MIDI loops and Drums &amp; Bass One Shots.</p>\r\n<p>MIDI files are included, so you can rework all the elements to fit into any project.</p>\r\n<p>LIVE GUITARS DO NOT CONTAIN MIDI FILES</p>\r\n<p>And of course, all loops &amp; samples are 100% Royalty-Free!</p>', 4200.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ihgCEFNnYDyVOID0aoyaf7989JwLZyUu/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d521390f0f0_Afro Sauce Guitar Afrobeats.webp', 'Commercial', '236 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/60641/Afro%20Sauce%20Demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Godlike-Loops-Afro-Sauce--Afrobeats.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 08:02:17', '2025-10-12 08:45:03', NULL),
(39, 34, NULL, 'Lova – Chill Afrobeats', 'lova-chill-afrobeats', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>90 Loops:</strong><br><em>45 Melody &amp; Bass Loops</em><br><em>35+ Drum &amp; Percussion Loops</em><br><em>5+ Vocal &amp; FX Loops</em></p>\r\n<p><em> </em></p>\r\n<p><strong>40 MIDI Files:</strong><br><em>20+ Melody MIDIs</em><br><em>15+ Drum &amp; Percussion MIDIs</em></p>\r\n<p><strong>70 Drum One-shots:<br></strong><em>30 Hihats &amp; Percussions</em><br><em>20 Kicks, 808 &amp; Bass</em><br><em>20 Snares &amp; claps</em></p>\r\n<p>100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p><strong>Size:</strong> 818 MB (<em>Zipped</em>)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Lova - Chill Afrobeats</strong>\' by <em>Fantastic lab</em> comes with&nbsp;<strong>90 Loops, 40 MIDI Files&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>70 Drum One-Shots,&nbsp;</strong>suitable for genres such as Afrobeats and Afropop.</p>\r\n<p>This gives you more options and flexibility than you can shake a stick at, to make things as big or small as you need without compromising the workflow. All in one box.</p>\r\n<p>And of course all loops &amp; samples are 100% Royalty-Free!</p>', 1700.00, 'ZIP', '', '', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d526dcd98d5_Lova-Chill-Afrobeats-cover-1.webp', 'Commercial', '861 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://producersources.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Lova-Demo.mp3', 'https://producersources.com/course/lova-chill-afrobeats/', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 08:26:20', '2025-10-12 08:41:23', NULL),
(40, 34, NULL, 'OBA | Afrobeat Sample Pack', 'oba-afrobeat-sample-pack', '<p><video controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\">\r\n<source src=\"https://video.wixstatic.com/video/22c04f_2c82ec60fa37415086e3c95310114a40/360p/mp4/file.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></p>\r\n<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">\'OBA: Afrobeats Sample Pack\'</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">&nbsp;is our monster Afrobeats Sample pack, put together by our team of producers with live Guitars, Keys, Vocals, and programmed percussions. This pack will bring the swing and trap affluence to all your afro beats.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">OBA</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">&nbsp;is equipped with 150+ WAV Loops (including Live Guitars, Vocals, Percussion loops, &amp; Drums), 83 banging One-Shot Drums &amp; 57 MIDI Files.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">All of our courses and 100% Royalty-Free!</span></p>', 5800.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zhwp0ie8QiayIS66syqdJc0j0N_eq6g7/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d52a1e19414_OBABox.webp', 'Commercial', '536 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', '', '', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 08:40:14', '2025-10-10 13:02:09', NULL),
(41, 34, NULL, 'Afrobeats Elements', 'afrobeats-elements', '<p>A new wave of Afrobeat inspired pop music has emerged and can be heard in songs such as &ldquo;One Dance by Drake&rdquo; and &ldquo;Oliver twist by D&rsquo;banj&rdquo; Auxurban Afrobeats elements are a selection of rhythmic elements that can be used as additives or as the foundation of your Afrobeat inspired courseion.</p>', 0.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vZzD7pALCfxQtQP5U9x_Djy8ZqEIsMxI/view?usp=drive_link', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d55ef40fe90_Afrobeats-Elements-WAV-FANTASTiC.jpg', 'Commercial', '93 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', '', '', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 12:25:40', '2025-10-10 13:00:14', NULL),
(42, 34, NULL, 'Motion: Afrobeats', 'motion-afrobeats', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 5 Construction Kits<br>&bull; 44 One Shot Drums<br>&bull; 140 Total WAV&nbsp;Files<br>&bull; All Files 44 KHz / 24 Bit<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; Mixed and Mastered WAV Files</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>Motion: Afrobeats from Major Loops is a collection of 5 Carefully Crafted Afro-beats Instrumentals and 44 One Shot Drum Samples.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This kit is perfect for producers of all experience levels who are looking to work with something different. It features 140 Total WAV Files including Guitars, Keys, Strings, and Synths that you can use for years to come. Every Loop in this kit was created at the highest quality. Samples are tracked out at the ends so you can cut the stems out and mix them however you want! Just drag and drop each WAV file into your DAW for an effortless beat making experience. Pick the sounds you like and hold onto the other sounds for later.</p>', 3500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vrB1it2YdzXFwbxdCIe0ZiGM_OYZGMgb/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d5638f10a3a_Motion.webp', 'Commercial', '44', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/57464/Motion%20Afrobeats%20Demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Major-Loops-Motion-Afrobeats.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-25 12:45:19', '2025-10-10 12:53:35', NULL),
(43, 35, NULL, 'Swing - Amapiano Hits', 'swing-amapiano-hits', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 137 WAV Loops (Including Drums, Melodics, Vocals)<br>&bull; 82 MIDI Files (Including Drums, Melodies)<br>&bull; 118 One Shots (Including Drums &amp; Instruments)<br>&bull; 44.1kHz/24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'SWING\' is an All-In-One Amapiano sample pack loaded with 137 WAV loops, 82 MIDI files &amp; 118 One Shots, Perfect for producers looking to create smashing Amapiano tracks that get people dancing. This new collection offers the essentials to craft authentic and high-quality Amapiano jam, a great choice for anyone wanting to dive into Amapiano courseion or add fresh sounds to their libraries.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This pack is a great choice for anyone looking to dive into Amapiano courseion or add fresh sounds to your collection! Featuring an array of expertly crafted sounds and tools including:</p>\r\n<p><strong>WAV Loops:</strong> Offering you must-have samples to produce your next hit tracks, including drums, percussions, basses, log drums, melodies, chords, keys, pianos, rhodes, leads, synths, saxes, pads, flutes, plucks, arps, vocals and more.</p>\r\n<p><strong>MIDI Files:</strong> Offering producers instant inspiration and endless creative possibilities. With MIDI files included, you can customize melodies to suit unique styles and visions, ensuring each composition stands out.</p>\r\n<p><strong>One Shots: </strong>This pack also includes one-shots of drums, empowering producers to remake beats &amp; fills, and create entirely new ones from scratch.</p>', 4500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/17ihmjrEur7sGSRsgJgyGdRw8XdBfvp_R/view?usp=drive_link', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d63cd441244_SWINGCoverArt.webp', 'Commercial', '250 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/65393/SWING%20Amapiano%20Demo.m