(44, 35, NULL, 'Hamba Amapiano', 'hamba-amapiano', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 223 WAV Loops (Including Drums, Melodics, and FXs)<br>&bull; 43 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 61 One-Shots<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Hamba Amapiano\' by Doctor Bazz is an All-In-One Sample Pack loaded with 223 WAV Loops, 43 MIDI Files, and 61 One-Shots. This sample Pack Is a complete treasure trove of Infectious Melodies and Groovy Drums that will take your music courseions to the next level.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This pack will provide you with must-have samples to help you produce your next hit track, including Drums, Melodics, and FXs.</p>\r\n<p>MIDI files are included so you can control your project thoroughly. The MIDI files allow you to apply the melodies to any sound. Alternatively, Drag and Drop the WAV files into your DAW of choice to get started on your next track.</p>', 5500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p3oDfpzDdET04d4qfzVdknpBl3uF2_oC/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d63defc9ede_hamba-amapiano-1.webp', 'Commercial', '1.33 GB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/62794/hamba%20full%20amapiano.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Doctor-Bazz-Hamba-Amapiano.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-26 04:17:03', '2025-10-10 12:50:37', NULL),
(45, 35, NULL, 'Amapiano Lord', 'amapiano-lord', '<h3><strong>course DETAILS:&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>42 Melody Loops<br>50 MIDI Files<br>481 One shot drums</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>21 Drum Loops<br>32 Percussions Loops<br>30 Shakers Loops</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>29 Instruments Presets (FL Studio)<br>31 LogDrum Presets (FL Studio)</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality</strong><br><strong>BPM and Key Labeled</strong><br><strong>100% Royalty-Free</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>\'Amapiano Lord\'</strong> is an All-In-One Sample Pack loaded with <strong>125 WAV Loops, 50 MIDI Files,</strong> <strong>481 One-Shots,</strong> and <strong>60 Fl Studio Presets </strong>to supply you with the most trending AMAPIANO sounds for your next <em>Amapiano </em><em>Hit</em><em> Record.</em></p>\r\n<p>This pack will provide you with must-have samples to help you produce your next hit track, including Drums, Percussions, Shakers, and Melodies.</p>\r\n<p>MIDI files are included so you can control your project thoroughly. The MIDI files allow you to apply the melodies to any sound. Alternatively, Drag and Drop the WAV files into your DAW of choice to get started on your next track.</p>', 6500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/15ryytIMclEBzK7eYpz0NIAwAAemASdR0/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d63ef7ca28c_Amapiano Lord_CoverArt.webp', 'Commercial', '432 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/59441/Amapiano%20Lord%20Demotrack.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Aotbb-Amapiano-Lord.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-26 04:21:27', '2025-10-10 12:48:51', NULL),
(46, 35, NULL, 'RSA Amapiano', 'rsa-amapiano', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 132 WAV Loops (Including Drums and Melodics)<br>&bull; 12 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 99 One-Shots<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'RSA Amapiano\' by LBandyMusic is an All-In-One Sample Pack loaded with 132 WAV Loops, 12 MIDI Files, and 99 One-Shots, this musical treasure trove is your passport to the heart of Amapiano\'s pulsating beats and soulful melodies. Let your creativity soar as you explore the extensive library of expertly crafted WAV loops. From hypnotic basslines that groove with infectious rhythm to ethereal melodies that transport you to another world, RSA Amapiano is a symphony of sonic diversity. Whether you\'re a budding producer or a seasoned maestro, these loops will breathe life into your music like never before.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Unleash your own musical genius with the 12 MIDI files at your disposal. These versatile files provide you with the ultimate creative canvas, allowing you to tweak, twist, and mold your melodies into unique compositions that resonate with your artistic vision.</p>', 3200.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YUKXia2F7SakO-FCETHKpmzLwNiFjAeD/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d640b93497f_RSA Amapiano cover.webp', 'Commercial', '352 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/63577/RSA%20Amapiano%20demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Lbandymusic-RSA-Amapiano.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-26 04:28:57', '2025-10-10 12:47:34', NULL),
(47, 35, NULL, 'Amapiano Chill', 'amapiano-chill', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 5 Samples &amp; Loops Kits<br>&bull; 5 WAV Full Mixes Demos<br>&bull; 5 MIDI Files Included<br>&bull; All Loops include Dry &amp; Wet Versions<br>&bull; 12 Drum Loops<br>&bull; 10 Kick Loops<br>&bull; 8 Snare Loops<br>&bull; 8 Rim Shot Loops<br>&bull; 8 Clap Loops<br>&bull; 18 Hi-Hat Loops<br>&bull; 4 Open-Hat Loops<br>&bull; 4 Cymbal Loops<br>&bull; 40 Perc Loops<br>&bull; 16 Log Drum Loops<br>&bull; 66 Synth Loops<br>&bull; 6 Electric Piano Loops<br>&bull; 2 Piano Loops<br>&bull; 6 Guitar Loops<br>&bull; 4 Strings Loops<br>&bull; 4 Flute Loops<br>&bull; 4 Saxophone Loops<br>&bull; 2 Choir Loops<br>&bull; 2 Harp Loops<br>&bull; 2 Sitar Loops<br>&bull; 18 Sound FXs<br>&bull; Loops Synced To BPM<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz/24-Bit<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Amapiano Chill\' by Mystic Samples kicks off this sublime series of Amapiano fused with smooth Chill Grooves unleashing the charming &amp; smooth symbiosis of Afro and Chill Music inspired by famous artists such as Kelvin Momo, MalumNator, Kabza De Small, Gaba Cannal and more.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Immerse yourself in the sumptuous tapestry of Afro Music rhythms and Chill Music and get ready to transcend boundaries with the 5 Samples &amp; Loops Kits encompassing High Quality WAV Samples &amp; Loops passionately crafted by Kryptic. Inside you\'ll find Synth loops: Arp, Keys, Lead, Pluck, Strings, Wind, Mallets, Pad &amp; Seq, Piano loops, Electric Piano loops, Guitar loops, Strings loops, Flute loops, Saxophone loops, Harp loops, Sitar loops, Choir loops, Sound Fxs, hard-hitting Log Drum loops, Perc Loops. Drum loops and more.</p>', 3600.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TkqM2tqrohjdWHiwwyoR_woEun9h-by8/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d641c0d77d6_Mystic Samples_Amapiano Chill_1400x1400.webp', 'Commercial', '791 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', ''