<br>&bull; 223 Total Files<br>&bull; 509.6 MB</p>', 4900.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/15Xu1zMwimVYh1RBn8J__6rGf963EDA2T/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d7edbf809e0_Afrobeats-Special-WAV-SERUM-FANTASTiC-MaGeSY.webp', 'Commercial', '371 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-09-27 10:59:27', '2025-09-27 10:59:27', NULL),
(64, 34, NULL, 'ASAHD-Afrobeats', 'asahd-afrobeats', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 135+&nbsp;WAV Loops<br>&bull; 85+ Drum Loops<br>&bull; 49+&nbsp;Melody Loops<br>&bull; 116 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 46 One-Shots<br>&bull; 44.1 kHz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\"ASAHD:Afrobeats\" is an All-in-One Sample Pack by Innoy, provides you with a 136 WAV Loops, 116 MIDI files, 46 One-Shot Drums, all grouped into 8 Construction kits that you also can use as beat starters and avoid courseion block.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This Sample Pack is a collection of clean &amp; tuned sounds, bouncy &amp; hard-hitting drums with a with banging 808s, inspired by the most trending Afrobeats &amp; Dancehall artists such as Burna boy, D banj, Rema, Wizkid, with a Moroccan extra touch by Innoy</p>\r\n<p>MIDI Files are Included in this Sample Pack to give you complete control over your project. The MIDI files allow you to apply the melodies to any sound. Alternatively, Drag and Drop the WAV files into your DAW of choice to get started on your next track.</p>\r\n<p>Inside, you\'ll find One-Shots Drums, allowing you to create new beats, fills, and loops to complement the existing material. Load them up into your sampler of choice and create an infinite number of Drum Loops.</p>', 2900.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FiCv6mBaJOQK81vVC3PqpnmKo5oCQ9qn/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d7ee9134865_ASAHD - Artcover.webp', 'Commercial', '150 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/56706/Demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Innoy-ASAHD-Afrobeats.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 11:02:57', '2025-10-08 12:47:21', NULL),
(65, 34, NULL, 'BENDIR-Afrobeats', 'bendir-afrobeats', '<p><span style=\"color: #333399;\"><strong>course Details:</strong></span><br>&bull; 6 Constuction Kits<br>&bull; 73&nbsp;WAV Loops:<br>&bull; 24&nbsp;Melody Loops<br>&bull; 49&nbsp;Drums Loops<br>&bull; 53 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 39 One Shots<br>&bull; 44.1 K Hz / 24-Bit WAV Quality<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\"BENDIR: Moroccan Afrobeats\"&nbsp;is an All-in-One Sample Pack by Innoy, provides you with a&nbsp;73 WAV Loops,&nbsp;53 MIDI files,&nbsp;39 One-Shot Drums,&nbsp;all grouped into&nbsp;6 Construction&nbsp;kits&nbsp;that you also can use as beat starters and avoid courseion block.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This Sample Pack is a collection of clean &amp; tuned sounds, bouncy &amp; hard-hitting drums with a with banging 808s, inspired by the most trending Afrobeats &amp; Dancehall artists such as Burna boy, D banj, Rema, Wizkid, with a Moroccan extra touch by Innoy</p>\r\n<p>MIDI Files are Included in this Sample Pack to give you complete control over your project. The MIDI files allow you to apply the melodies to any sound. Alternatively, Drag and Drop the WAV files into your DAW of choice to get started on your next track.</p>\r\n<p>Inside, you\'ll find One-Shots Drums, allowing you to create new beats, fills, and loops to complement the existing material. Load them up into your sampler of choice and create an infinite number of Drum Loops.</p>', 2900.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1e1R1_ivc_bOrCqQBpuZ24nmm4MTkdnt-/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d7ef6b0bbeb_Bendir (1).webp', 'Commercial', '97 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://r-loops-cdn.s3.amazonaws.com/course/demo-song/63d41f8c8d95d.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Innoy-BENDIR-Afrobeats.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 11:06:35', '2025-10-08 12:45:16', NULL),
(66, 34, NULL, 'Afro Starter', 'afro-starter', '<p>A nice collection of Afrobeats rythmic elements to help you kickstart any Afrobeat projects in a dime&hellip;..enjoy</p>', 1500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zTzcN6SYggjkHtR-jqBUtoJuNnSfzlPl/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d7f1c978cf7_Negusfirst-Afro-Starters-WAV-FANTASTiC-MaGeSY.webp', 'Commercial', '54', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://d2wxqn8zvcy925.cloudfront.net/mp3/FMWeQab7Rt495M1P2E1IE19n5MUfPOYslCkoESGc117025fHZ1Z.mp3', 'https://afrobeatproducers.com/', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 11:16:41', '2025-10-08 12:37:41', NULL),
(67, 34, NULL, 'Wakanda Afrobeats Samples', 'wakanda-afrobeats-samples', '<div id=\"col-583477485\" class=\"col medium-9 small-12 large-9\">\r\n<div class=\"col-inner\">\r\n<h2>FEATURES:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 x Beat Construction Kits</li>\r\n<li>103 x Drum &amp; Melody Loops</li>\r\n<li>38 x MIDI Files</li>\r\n<li>Key &amp; Tempo Labelled</li>\r\n<li>24-Bit WAV Audio Quality</li>\r\n<li>100% Royalty-Free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Wakanda - Afrobeats Samples</strong> sound library by Jungle Loops is equipped with the essential Afrobeat sounds and samples needed to create that smashing Afrobeat and Amapiano beats. It comes with 103 WAV Loops and 38 MIDI Files inspired by Daddy Yankee, MFR Souls, Youssoupha, Nicky Jam, Wizkid, Burna Boy, Kizz Daniel, Davido, Tems, Buju, Omah Lay, Teni, and more.</p>\r\n<p>This sound pack will provide you with must-have samples to help you produce your next hit track including Electric Pianos, Keys, Vocal Chops, Horns, Flutes, Leads, Log Drums, Pads, Basses, Kick Loops, Snare &amp; Rim Loops, Shaker Loops, Various Perc Loops, Full / Top Drum Loops, and MIDI Loops.</p>\r\n<p>Included are <strong>MIDI Files</strong> to give you complete control over your project. The MIDI Files allow you to apply the melodies to any sound. Alternatively, Drag and Drop the WAV files into your DAW of choice to get started on your next track. And of course, all loops &amp; samples are <strong>100% Royalty-Free!</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 3200.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NMN3LaUHoI7DgloqlEaAuq4MRZRk2Zdj/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d7f3edee1c2_Jungle-Loops-Wakanda-Afrobeats-Samples.webp', 'Commercial', '228 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/57870/Jungle%20Loops%20Wakanda%20%20%20Afrobeats%20Samples%20demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Jungle-Loops-Wakanda--Afrobeats-Samples.html?srsltid=AfmBOopGzWTkRzT-AH_aW6YAS7wvxg7VHEAnOk2GVNHSHgfR6YtIZ8pY', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 11:25:49', '2025-10-08 12:31:57', NULL),
(68, 34, NULL, 'Africano - Afrobeats & Latino', 'africano-afrobeats-latino', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 5 Mixed &amp; Mastered Demos<br>&bull; 77 WAV Loops<br>&bull; 35 MIDI Files<br>&bull; 34 One Shots<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; WAV 24bit / HQ<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Africano - Afrobeats &amp; Latino\' by Godlike Loops is equipped with the essential sounds and materials needed to create that smashing Afrobeat records. It comes with 150+ Files, including 77 WAV Loops, 34 Drums &amp; FX One-Shots , and 35 MIDI Files inspired by Maluma, MFR Souls, Youssoupha, Nicky Jam, Wizkid,Burna Boy, Kizz Daniel, Davido, Tems, Buju, Omah Lay, Teni and more.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This pack will provide you with must-have samples to help you produce your next hit track including Guitars, Pianos, Saxes, Leads, Rhodes, Keys, Trumpets, Basses, Kick Loops, Snare &amp; Rim Loops, Shaker Loops, Various Perc Loops, Full / Top Drum Loops, Drum Fills, MIDI loops and Drums &amp; Bass One Shots.</p>\r\n<p>MIDI files are included, so you can rework all the elements to fit into any project.</p>\r\n<p>Live Guitars does not contain MIDI Files.</p>\r\n<p>And of course, all loops &amp; samples are 100% Royalty-Free!</p>', 5500.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1crf7Viw1EIxyCZEO9lrJfFXdL5gSLZaa/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d7f4f32454c_Africano Afrobeats Latino Graphic.webp', 'Commercial', '168 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/60307/Cash%20Flow%20Demo%20Mp3.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Godlike-Loops-Africano--Afrobeats-Latino.html?srsltid=AfmBOor52q3k7pDpqADVaJEPLRyb7Z_r1XUIVtV1-ZVCPaud59Sfpp9H', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 11:30:11', '2025-10-08 12:27:13', NULL),
(69, 37, NULL, 'Mad Max', 'mad-max', '<p><strong>course Details:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull; 5 Construction Kits<br>&bull; 5 Mixed &amp; Mastered Demos<br>&bull; 56 WAV Loops<br>&bull; 47 MIDI Files<br>&bull; Key &amp; Tempo Labelled<br>&bull; 313 MB of Content (Unzipped)<br>&bull; 100% Royalty-Free</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>\'Mad Max\' comes with 5 Trap Construction Kits filled with 56 WAV loops and 47 MIDI Files inspired by the styles of 808Mafia, Future, Metro Boomin and many more. Those are going to help you produce dark and dynamic compositions which are perfect for this time of the year.</strong></p>\r\n<p>MIDI files are included, so you can rework all the elements to fit into any project. This pack is your key to professional beats and a must-have for any producer looking to build up their sample library.</p>\r\n<p>All loops are 100% Royalty-Free, so you can use them into your commercial compositions at no extra cost.</p>', 4600.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/11WAnktspKNbuMUUtSWbZOwePjYW5fXSN/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d84e733c7fc_mad_max.webp', 'Commercial', '134 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/58029/Cartel%20Loops%20%20%20MadMax%20Demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Cartel-Loops-Mad-Max.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 17:52:03', '2025-10-08 12:15:27', NULL),
(70, 37, NULL, 'Colorz Red', 'colorz-red', '<p>Colorz Red by Big Citi Loops is a collection of 48 samples that are intended to build&nbsp;Hip Hop, Trap music. The sample pack consists of carefully prepared samples of instruments such as Piano, Electric Piano, Guitar, Keys, Synth .&nbsp;All samples are licensed as Royalty-Free for you to use in your commercial courseions or even for DJ/Remix purposes. Spark your creativity with Colorz Red from Big Citi Loops and give your unfinished tracks exactly what they need to come back to life. Just drag and drop the WAV files into your favourite DAW and you\'re good to go.</p>', 1800.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_ehvzlgQ6wWcF7O2ZIYMuCyiLwFH8kjc/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d853e51bb05_7a07e1962e5bed19998d4086c18db09d.jpg', 'Commercial', '83 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.slooply.com/public/demo-mp3/5ec19d048e8c5.mp3', 'https://slooply.com/sample-pack/colorz-red', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 18:15:17', '2025-10-08 11:59:39', NULL),
(71, 37, NULL, 'Boom In', 'boom-in', '<div><strong>course Details:</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&bull; 6 Construction Kits</div>\r\n<div>&bull; 6 MIDI Files Included</div>\r\n<div>&bull; 24-Bit/48kHz Quality</div>\r\n<div>&bull; Tempo Labelled</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"lead\">\'Boom In\' is a raw, vibrating dark Trap &amp; Urban sample collection jam-packed with the most trendsetting sounds designed by Crude Sounds, the new sub-label of Kryptic Samples for the Trap and Urban Music connoisseur.</p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>This music library comes across with six astonishing Construction Kits, featuring a wide range of modernistic synth pads, trance-inducing piano loops, strapping drums and ground-shaking 808 bass loops and samples to be chopped, stretched and pitched as well as the MIDI files.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>If you are looking for a high quality modernised &amp; crisp collection of audio and MIDI and instant inspiration all gathered in one stunning pack, \'Boom In\' is unmistakably for you.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>MIDI Files Included:</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Like all other Crude Sounds courses, \'Boom In\' includes MIDI files for the musical phrases heard in the demo. Use the MIDI files in your favourite DAW to customise the sounds to your liking.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>Advantages of MIDI:</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>MIDI files supplied in this pack are flexible and powerful allowing you to assign any of the musical phrases to your favourite synth or sampler and is only instructional data, so you can change the pitch and tempo beyond which the loops were originally recorded to any extent you like, with no artefacts.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 5400.00, 'ZIP', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZIzwzPFV_3V2te5hOWcMw2yjtJfjt0YZ/view?usp=sharing', 'uploads/thumbnails/68d8551a845e1_Crude Sounds-Boom In (800x800).webp', 'Commercial', '120 MB', 'AK23STUDIOKITS', 'ak23studiokits.com', '', 'https://cdn.producerloops.com/files/audio/37632/Boom%20In%20Demo.mp3', 'https://www.producerloops.com/Download-Crude-Sounds-Boom-In.html', 1, 0, '2025-09-27 18:20:26', '2025-10-08 10:21:51', NULL);
